{"abstract":"Objective: To describe different electrophysiological, histopathological, and ultrastructural patterns of muscle pathology in COVID-19-associated intensive care unit acquired weakness (ICUAW) and raise the question of whether COVID-19-associated critical illness myopathy (CIM) is a distinct entity or is similar to CIM of other causes. Methods: A series of three patients with COVID-19-associated ICUAW were presented. Clinical examination, electrophysiological testing, and muscle pathology with light and electron microscopy were reported systematically. Results: All three patients were clinically affected with severe proximal and distal weakness of upper and lower extremities, increased plasma levels of muscle enzymes, and had myopathic electromyography. Furthermore, in two patients, electrophysiological signs of inflammatory myopathy with profuse denervation activity were present. Muscle pathologies were prominent but very diverse. One patient had signs of CIM, another showed severe inflammatory myopathy, and the main finding in the third patient was mitochondrial changes. Conclusion: Although the three cases showed similar clinical and electrophysiological patterns, muscle pathology revealed distinct underlying features. This spectrum of muscle disease among patients with severe COVID-19 includes CIM, autoimmune response to the COVID-19 infection, and mitochondrial dysfunction. Significance: Electrophysiology and histopathology complement each other and are important for determining the etiology, as well as guiding treatment and prognosis.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Hejbøl, Eva K.","Lomstein, Atle Vigild","Schrøder, Henrik D.","Khan, Benjamin","Harbo, Thomas","Tankisi, Hatice"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-813599"],"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Tankisi, Hatice"],"keyword":["Covid 19","Critical illness myopathy","Electromyography","Intensive care unit acquired weakness","Muscle biopsy"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"neurophysiology and muscle histopathology in icu acquired muscle weakness lessons learned from covid 000000000019","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cnp.2025.05.001","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-813599","identifier":[{"id":"PMC12145520","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"40486243","type":"pmid"},{"id":"105005175823","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-37d60125-6062-40d6-b437-b38a636158c3","sdu-c396b6ba-db88-45c2-a904-54b757207fd8"],"keyword":["COVID-19","Critical illness myopathy","Electromyography","Intensive care unit acquired weakness","Muscle biopsy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-86360BBB047285131BCD87122AC7F04F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cnp.2025.05.001","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/290286355/1-s2.0-S2467981X25000216-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Pathology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Neurology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Eva K.","key":"hejbølpau","last":"Hejbøl","locid":"a1436b7e-a7e8-40fe-9f65-7595dfccbb2f","name":"Hejbøl, Eva Kildall","name_org":"Hejbøl, Eva K.","orcid":"0000-0002-3462-321X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Atle V.","key":"lomsteinpau","last":"Lomstein","locid":"864c3e0b-983f-42cf-b5c1-5976365c00ec","name":"Lomstein, Atle Vigild","name_org":"Lomstein, Atle V.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik D.","key":"schrøderpau","last":"Schrøder","locid":"45f34f3c-9832-41b5-813a-585261681c55","name":"Schrøder, Henrik Daa","name_org":"Schrøder, Henrik D.","orcid":"0000-0001-7588-235X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Benjamin","key":"khanpau","last":"Khan","locid":"349867e7-1b5a-444a-bfb6-e98f5da5f0f3","name":"Khan, Benjamin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"harbopau","last":"Harbo","locid":"2211c8bc-9fc1-4ccd-9704-f0f8571d923a","name":"Harbo, Thomas","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hatice","key":"tankisipau","last":"Tankisi","locid":"2b3f7bfd-71e0-4e1e-9a63-62cf6d26d1ea","name":"Tankisi, Hatice","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40486243"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.cnp.2025.05.001","issn":["2467981X"],"journal":"Clinical Neurophysiology Practice","pages":"172-180","publisher":"Elsevier BV","publisher_org":"Elsevier B.V.","status":"p","title":"Clinical Neurophysiology Practice","volume":"10"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105005175823"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-37d60125-6062-40d6-b437-b38a636158c3","sdu-c396b6ba-db88-45c2-a904-54b757207fd8"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Neurophysiology and muscle histopathology in ICU-acquired muscle weakness : Lessons learned from COVID-19","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-813599","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Gåderum, såkaldte escape rooms, vinder frem i underholdningsbranchen, men også i undervisningssammenhænge. Der findes dog ikke et empirisk forskningsgrundlag inden for anvendelse af gåderum i undervisning. Artiklen undersøger således, hvordan tilstedeværelse i fysiske gåderum kan skabe undersøgende tilgange i relation til fagligt indhold på videregående uddannelser. Det empiriske fundament er baseret på en eksperimenterende case, hvor højskoleelever fra Spiludviklingslinjen på Vallekilde Højskole har designet et gåderum målrettet faget videnskabsteori for bachelorstuderende på Kommunikation og digitale medier på Aalborg Universitet, København. Casen analyseres med udgangspunkt i didaktisk teori og spilteori med fokus på, hvordan man rammesætter undervisningen, så de lærende kan agere både spildesignere af og spillere i didaktiske gåderum. Artiklen påviser nødvendigheden af, at underviseren skaber rammer, indenfor hvilke deltagernes uformelle spilkompetencer og faglig viden kommer i spil. Ligeledes er det vigtigt at skabe balance mellem spiloplevelsen, gåderummets indbyggede tvetydigheder og faglige mål i undervisningen.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hautopp, Heidi","Ejsing-Duun, Stine","Vigild, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-058404"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Didaktisk design","Læring","Roller","Spildesign"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Vallekilde Højskole"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"didaktisk gåderum som læringsredskab på videregående uddannelser","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 3.0","type":"rem","url":"https://tidsskrift.dk/lom/article/view/109588/161846","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-058404","ids":["aau-1c9e88e6-f266-4d90-a647-1dd108ca5c28"],"keyword":["Didaktisk design","gåderum","læring","mixed-media space","roller","spildesign"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A5CA8DB9050776BF2E27B158DA0F0F1E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 3.0","type":"rem","url":"https://tidsskrift.dk/lom/article/view/109588/161846","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, ILD - Forskningslab i IT og Læringsdesign (Learning)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities, Department of Learning and Philosophy, Research Center for VidEO: Video in Education and the learning Organisation (Learning)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, ILD-LAB – Research lab for IT and Learning Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, The Center for Applied Game Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Vallekilde Højskole"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Heidi","key":"hautopppau","last":"Hautopp","locid":"0993cb33-a065-4e3d-92e7-6a706904ccf6","name":"Hautopp, Heidi","orcid":"0000-0003-3567-7727","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Stine","key":"ejsingduunpau","last":"Ejsing-Duun","locid":"93a1ba27-980c-4370-92a4-121934a02c5a","name":"Ejsing-Duun, Stine","orcid":"0000-0001-7162-4505","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"vigildpau","last":"Vigild","name":"Vigild, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["1903248X"],"issue":"20","journal":"Læring og Medier","publisher":"Statsbiblioteket","status":"p","title":"Læring og Medier","title_org":"Tidsskriftet Læring og Medier (LOM)","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-1c9e88e6-f266-4d90-a647-1dd108ca5c28"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Didaktisk gåderum : - som læringsredskab på videregående uddannelser","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-058404","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
